  "description": "Our favourite way to enjoy vegetables (and we hope it’s yours too) is in a stir-fry. Simply chop, add sauce, fry and serve over rice - yum! This stir-fry is deliciously sweet, sticky and gingery; you’ll really have to try your best not to eat all the veggies straight out of the wok. The fast cook time adds yet another reason to love this dish - save this one for a night you’re really hungry because it will be ready in a flashy 30 minutes!",
